[
  {
    "content_id": "10063001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我这做长老的写信给蒙拣选的女士和你的儿女，就是我本着真理所爱的。不但我爱你们，一切认识真理的人也都爱你们，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;这是因为真理在我们里面，并且永远与我们同在。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;父上帝和祂儿子耶稣基督的恩典、怜悯和平安，必在真理和爱中与我们同在！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我看见你一些儿女按照我们从父领受的命令遵行真理，感到非常欣慰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;女士啊，我现在劝你，我们要彼此相爱。这不是新命令，而是我们从起初就已经领受的命令。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;爱就是遵行上帝的命令。你们要活出爱，这是你们从起初就听到的命令。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因为许多骗子已经来到世上，他们否认耶稣基督曾降世为人。这样的人是骗子，是敌基督者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们要谨慎，好得到完满的赏赐，免得我们前功尽弃。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;凡偏离基督教导的人，都没有上帝；凡遵守基督教导的人，都有父和子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;若有人到你们那里不传基督的教导，不要请他到家里，也不要问候他，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因为问候他就是与他同流合污。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我还有许多事要告诉你们，但不想借助纸墨，只希望到你们那里当面畅谈，使我们喜乐满溢。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你那蒙拣选之姊妹的儿女问候你。</p>"
  }
]